[
    {
        "content": "<p>Hi, I have a proof (found with AI) of a new result.  I wrote a paper, which I then had autoformalized in lean.  I would like to submit the paper to arxiv and have the lean proof appear on Palomar, preferably simultaneously, or otherwise as close together as possible.  Is there a recommended way to go about this?  If I submit first to palomar, and then to arxiv, can I then update the palomar submission with a link to the arxiv paper?  <br>\nThanks for any help!</p>",
        "id": 618123590,
        "sender_full_name": "Benjamin Dozier",
        "timestamp": 1787427574
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"1190306\">@Benjamin Dozier</span> (Hi Ben!)   This response is a personal one, not on behalf of others.  I see Palomar as supporting, and arXiv as your primary document/artifact.  (This is a somewhat political statement:  the natural language description is the primary, and the formalization is secondary.  I can see someone else arguing that the formalization is precise and should be the primary, with the arXiv an informal an imprecise \"explanation\" for meat.)  Then I would think that the right thing would be: Palomar first, then the arXiv entry can refer to Palomar.  Then later update the Palomar entry to point to arXiv.   (Functionally I guess there isn't a huge difference; but I think this isn't worth the cost of a v2 of an arXiv article.)</p>",
        "id": 618136210,
        "sender_full_name": "Ravi Vakil",
        "timestamp": 1787439452
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>And yes, you can update your palomar submission: if you just resubmit with the same repository (and comparator file if you have multiple), it will automatically generated a new version number for the same identifier.</p>",
        "id": 618144129,
        "sender_full_name": "Kim Morrison",
        "timestamp": 1787444243
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I had arXiv accept a <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.15520\">formalization of  Scott 1972 Continuous Lattices</a> under the cs.LO and math.LO rubrics.</p>\n<p>Then I submitted a formalization of <a href=\"https://github.com/catskillsresearch/scott1980\">Scott's 1980-1981 PRG19 on neighborhood systems</a>.  Using the same LLMs, the same proof methodology.  It was way longer because a longer paper and I was meticulous about formalizing <em>everything</em>, definitions, lemmas, theorems, examples, and asides of the form \"one may show that\".  This got rejected by arXiv, not for technical reasons (1500 pages of Lean code) but, in ticket MOD-97335, because, after 3 weeks of pondering, the cs.LO and math.LO moderators proclaimed:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Our moderators have determined that your submission is on a topic not covered by arXiv or that the intended audience for your work is not a community we currently serve.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Mmkay.  This was a signal for me to move all of my work to <a href=\"https://hal.science/\">HAL.science</a>  and to simply forget that arXiv ever existed.</p>\n<p>I then did <a href=\"https://github.com/catskillsresearch/scott1982\">Scott 1982</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/catskillsresearch/scott_models\">a set of bridge theorems between 1972, 1980 and 1982</a>.  I put the bridge theorems into Palomar, with the net effect of vendoring in the full set of 1972, 1980 and 1982 formalizations, and, after breaking the LLM 2 times</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T14</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Preparation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mechanical</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">verification</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">queued</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T14</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">37</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">52</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Verification</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">success</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T14</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">41</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">02</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">automated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">running</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T14</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">44</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">54</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">automated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">did</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">complete</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">will</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tried</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">again</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T17</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">53</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">automated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">running</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T17</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">03</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">59</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">automated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">did</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">complete</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">will</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tried</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">again</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">7.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T18</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">21</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">09</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">automated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">running</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">8.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T18</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">52</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">editorial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ready</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">you</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">9.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T18</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">17</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">submitter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">asked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">registered</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T18</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">33</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">01</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Registration</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">starting</span>\n<span class=\"mf\">11.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T18</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">44</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">33</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Registration</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">needs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">operator</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">attention</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>got the happy result</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">This</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">an</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">automated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">your</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">formal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">statements</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">agree</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">informal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">account</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">them</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whether</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">plausibly</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interest</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">No</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">person</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">read</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">It</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">private</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nobody</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">but</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">you</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Palomar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">moderation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">team</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">can</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">see</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stays</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">that</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">way</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unless</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">you</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">register</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Automated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span>\n<span class=\"n\">No</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">problems</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">were</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">identified</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Reviewed</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">2026</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">08</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"n\">T18</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">39</span><span class=\"n\">Z</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Reviewer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">models</span>\n<span class=\"n\">codex</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">gpt</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">5.6</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">sol</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Mechanical</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">verification</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">succeeded</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">editorial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">review</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">identified</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">no</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">blocking</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">problem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">statements</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">definitions</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">presentation</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">provenance</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">literature</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">account</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">research</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interest</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>followed by the frustrating notice</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Registration</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">paused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">while</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Palomar's</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">operators</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">address</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">problem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>which is where we are now.</p>\n<p>So from my point of view, the answer to the question \"how to simultaneously stage Palomar and arXiv\" is \"credential it on Palomar and then submit the writeup on <a href=\"http://HAL.science\">HAL.science</a>\" and then forget that arXiv exists, at least for long formalizations that cs.LO and math.LO consider to be not clubbable.</p>",
